rule quota_check v1
description "Whether a request for part of a quota is granted at once or reviewed. What was used and what is asked never come to more than the quota, which the rule takes for granted: a precondition dandori cannot show where the two come from tasks with no range, so the workflow checks it when it runs (tests/flows/quota.flow)"

enum path = at_once | review

inputs
  used      : number  range >=0 <=1000
  requested : number  range >=0 <=1000
  quota     : number  range >=1 <=1000

constraint used + requested <= quota

outputs
  route : path

table pick
policy unique
| requested | -> route : path |
| <=100     | at_once         |
| >100      | review          |

examples
| used | requested | quota | -> route |
| 400  | 100       | 1000  | at_once  |
| 400  | 300       | 1000  | review   |
